WEBVTT

00:00:02.874 --> 00:00:03.744
What's this?

00:00:03.744 --> 00:00:05.544
What, what, what?

00:00:05.544 --> 00:00:07.014
Oh, it's a love letter.

00:00:07.014 --> 00:00:09.034
I think so. Here.

00:00:10.954 --> 00:00:12.544
Oh, it's from a girl!

00:00:13.924 --> 00:00:16.224
All I ever get are ones from girls.

00:00:16.224 --> 00:00:17.854
She's pretty cute.

00:00:17.854 --> 00:00:20.264
I thought a creeper like you would like that.

00:00:20.264 --> 00:00:24.194
I may be a creeper, but I'm
after fully-fledged women!

00:00:24.194 --> 00:00:28.104
Besides, I only like pretty, sexy adults!

00:00:28.104 --> 00:00:32.064
I don't care about flat-chested little girls!

00:00:33.374 --> 00:00:34.574
Right, right.

00:00:34.574 --> 00:00:39.564
One day, you understand what it's
like to have a face this popular...

00:00:41.014 --> 00:00:43.154
Great, I've got ones from even more new boys.

00:00:43.154 --> 00:00:45.354
I can't keep track of all the names.

00:00:45.354 --> 00:00:47.054
I can't even get my shoes in here today.

00:00:47.054 --> 00:00:49.714
These two are just a walking
lump of pheromones!

00:00:50.324 --> 00:00:53.224
Kanari kiteru Muteki no Power!

00:00:53.624 --> 00:00:56.494
Maji de ii kanji

00:00:56.864 --> 00:00:59.624
Zettai karen! Dakara makenai!

00:01:00.064 --> 00:01:03.234
Ashita e saa ikou!

00:01:05.134 --> 00:01:06.274
Zettai Karen Children

00:01:06.274 --> 00:01:07.444
Zettai Karen Children
Yeah!

00:01:07.444 --> 00:01:08.704
Zettai Karen Children
Zettai!

00:01:08.704 --> 00:01:10.374
Zettai Karen Children

00:01:10.374 --> 00:01:11.404
Zettai Karen Children
Daitan!

00:01:11.574 --> 00:01:14.884
Fureau dake de wakaru

00:01:14.884 --> 00:01:17.314
Kokoro no limiter

00:01:18.054 --> 00:01:20.744
Tokihanatareta hora

00:01:21.154 --> 00:01:24.354
Yes! Change the world!

00:01:24.594 --> 00:01:27.454
Atsui battle Nandomo try!

00:01:27.764 --> 00:01:31.064
Real wo tsuranuite

00:01:31.064 --> 00:01:34.304
Zettai karen! Dakara makenai!

00:01:34.304 --> 00:01:37.234
Thrill ga SAIKOU!

00:01:38.374 --> 00:01:44.844
Yuuki ga sekai no yami wo terashi hajimeru

00:01:44.844 --> 00:01:50.784
Anata ga kureta kiseki afureru

00:01:51.214 --> 00:01:57.614
Darenimo nitenai egao hokori ni shitara

00:01:57.824 --> 00:02:02.364
Mirai wo ima koeyou

00:02:02.364 --> 00:02:06.454
We can try over the future world!

00:02:06.704 --> 00:02:07.064
Yeah!

00:02:07.804 --> 00:02:08.464
Saidai!

00:02:10.604 --> 00:02:11.834
Daitan!

00:02:20.714 --> 00:02:21.344
18th sense.
"Passionate Love Comes to Light!
The Children's Breakup Crisis!"

00:02:21.344 --> 00:02:22.784
18th sense.
"Passionate Love Comes to Light!
The Children's Breakup Crisis!"
Still, I kind of understand that.

00:02:22.784 --> 00:02:23.214
Still, I kind of understand that.

00:02:23.214 --> 00:02:26.124
There's just something different about you three.

00:02:26.124 --> 00:02:28.484
Right, right! You seem so grown up.

00:02:28.484 --> 00:02:29.624
Me, too?

00:02:29.624 --> 00:02:30.524
Yes!

00:02:30.594 --> 00:02:32.254
You're so cool, Akashi!

00:02:32.254 --> 00:02:34.054
You're just so manly!

00:02:34.124 --> 00:02:37.964
Please, see me as a girl! I'll mend my ways!

00:02:37.964 --> 00:02:42.124
It's because we've only ever had
adults around us. That's all.

00:02:42.734 --> 00:02:44.834
No, not just that. We don't pass through

00:02:44.834 --> 00:02:47.204
the "darkness of the human heart" like you do.

00:02:48.274 --> 00:02:49.574
Oh, but Level 2's like us

00:02:49.574 --> 00:02:52.744
can only read the mood of
another person's heart.

00:02:52.744 --> 00:02:54.014
Right, Chisato?

00:02:54.014 --> 00:02:56.744
Why do I sense a horrible
darkness all of a sudden?

00:02:57.254 --> 00:02:59.824
But you aren't planning on
dating anyone now, right?

00:02:59.824 --> 00:03:02.514
Of course not! I mean, elementary
school boys are just...

00:03:02.994 --> 00:03:05.354
Yes! Rare card!

00:03:06.464 --> 00:03:09.434
...stupid little kids,
from our point of view.

00:03:09.434 --> 00:03:11.194
Nobody's very refined.

00:03:11.494 --> 00:03:13.864
Oh, I don't think so.

00:03:13.864 --> 00:03:16.074
If he was cute and shared
my interests, I'd date one.

00:03:16.074 --> 00:03:17.934
Really?! Seriously?!

00:03:17.934 --> 00:03:20.044
What kind of boy do you like?
How about a fat one?

00:03:20.044 --> 00:03:21.064
That'd be okay.

00:03:23.444 --> 00:03:25.114
Still...

00:03:25.114 --> 00:03:29.014
They set the bar so high that no normal
boy would ever measure up for them...

00:03:29.014 --> 00:03:30.554
Kaoru, you promised Mr. Minamoto

00:03:30.554 --> 00:03:33.154
that you wouldn't use your
powers at school, remember?

00:03:33.154 --> 00:03:35.454
Carry it, like a regular elementary school kid.

00:03:37.124 --> 00:03:39.714
My promise expires the moment
I step outside the school...

00:03:40.324 --> 00:03:43.354
Hey! What's the big idea,
stopping short like that?!

00:03:45.194 --> 00:03:48.254
Um... Miss Sannomiya?

00:03:48.964 --> 00:03:52.494
Did you read my letter, Miss Nogami?

00:03:53.244 --> 00:03:54.444
Hige...

00:03:54.444 --> 00:03:56.174
I did, but...

00:03:56.174 --> 00:04:00.184
Look... Would you come
see my game this Sunday?

00:04:00.184 --> 00:04:01.384
Sure.

00:04:01.384 --> 00:04:03.574
W-Would you come to the planetarium with me?

00:04:04.214 --> 00:04:05.314
You'll take me?!

00:04:06.224 --> 00:04:10.354
Y-Y-You suddenly have boyfriends?!

00:04:11.194 --> 00:04:12.564
Reporting, sir!

00:04:12.564 --> 00:04:15.364
Hiroshi Kuroki. Grades: at the top of his class.

00:04:15.364 --> 00:04:18.834
Personality: extremely gentle.
Main interest: astronomy.

00:04:18.834 --> 00:04:21.104
Shogo Hige. All-around athlete.

00:04:21.104 --> 00:04:23.504
Extremely popular in his class.

00:04:23.504 --> 00:04:26.374
I don't think there's a problem
with either of them, sir.

00:04:26.374 --> 00:04:29.344
You're naive! Men are wolves!

00:04:29.344 --> 00:04:30.574
Be careful!

00:04:30.574 --> 00:04:33.014
You must take care when they reach this age!

00:04:33.014 --> 00:04:34.984
With their faces that seem like
they wouldn't hurt a fly

00:04:34.984 --> 00:04:39.714
and their sweet words, they will
steal my precious girls away!

00:04:40.024 --> 00:04:42.594
Chief, you're overreacting!

00:04:42.594 --> 00:04:44.654
We mustn't take them at face value!

00:04:44.654 --> 00:04:48.464
Have the surveillance team plant
hidden cameras in the boys' rooms!

00:04:48.464 --> 00:04:50.064
Is that legal?

00:04:50.064 --> 00:04:54.204
FOOL! Don't you care what happens
to our national treasures?!

00:04:54.204 --> 00:04:55.804
These girls are in a pinch!

00:04:55.804 --> 00:04:56.824
Yes, sir...

00:05:20.564 --> 00:05:22.224
I'm Kaoru Akashi!

00:05:22.294 --> 00:05:25.694
I'll be staying here from now on!
How do you do?

00:05:33.974 --> 00:05:36.674
I said, "How do you do?"

00:05:37.644 --> 00:05:41.374
We'll be friends from now on!
Let's be nice to each other!

00:05:43.084 --> 00:05:46.784
Which is what I said, but first thing
in the morning, they're gone!

00:05:47.354 --> 00:05:50.284
Huh? Shiho and Aoi? They left hours ago.

00:05:50.794 --> 00:05:51.924
Where to?

00:05:51.924 --> 00:05:54.294
Shiho went to see a friend's soccer game,

00:05:54.294 --> 00:05:57.334
and I think Aoi went to the
planetarium or something.

00:05:57.334 --> 00:05:58.884
I see...

00:05:59.434 --> 00:06:01.954
Looks like a nice day out.

00:06:03.504 --> 00:06:06.764
You seem kind of down, Kaoru.
Something happen?

00:06:07.174 --> 00:06:10.764
Oh, just the possible collapse of our whole team.

00:06:12.044 --> 00:06:14.214
I don't know what's going on here,

00:06:14.214 --> 00:06:18.114
but I don't think your friendship
can break up that easily.

00:06:18.884 --> 00:06:22.924
It's such a nice Sunday.
Wanna come shopping with me?

00:06:22.924 --> 00:06:24.754
And she's already gone...

00:06:24.954 --> 00:06:26.484
PLANETARIUM NANBU

00:06:29.864 --> 00:06:31.194
Miss Nogami!

00:06:31.194 --> 00:06:33.184
Sorry I'm late!

00:06:33.734 --> 00:06:35.304
Sorry. Were you waiting long?

00:06:35.304 --> 00:06:38.904
No, and we've got some time
before the show starts.

00:06:38.904 --> 00:06:41.004
Oh, then why don't we take a walk?

00:06:41.004 --> 00:06:42.494
Sure!

00:06:47.684 --> 00:06:50.014
I really don't think we should be following them.

00:06:50.014 --> 00:06:52.184
We must! Men are wolves!

00:06:52.184 --> 00:06:55.824
With their non-fly killing faces and
sweet words and stuff like that!

00:06:55.824 --> 00:06:57.414
Stuff like what?

00:06:57.624 --> 00:07:01.194
Besides, we've always been together.

00:07:01.194 --> 00:07:04.164
Them getting boyfriends is like we've
suddenly been torn apart.

00:07:04.164 --> 00:07:07.364
Getting boyfriends doesn't
change your friendship!

00:07:07.364 --> 00:07:08.904
Yes, it does!

00:07:08.904 --> 00:07:11.674
The three of us will be going home
from school, side by side,

00:07:11.674 --> 00:07:14.804
and we'll run into their boyfriends and
they'll be all "Sorry, catch you later!"

00:07:14.804 --> 00:07:16.974
and just leave me there!

00:07:16.974 --> 00:07:18.464
Oh, is that how it works?

00:07:20.414 --> 00:07:22.414
Tono here! Akashi, this is serious!

00:07:22.414 --> 00:07:24.954
Tono! What is it?! What's happened to Shiho?!

00:07:24.954 --> 00:07:26.814
You've dragged Tono into this, too?!

00:07:26.884 --> 00:07:30.324
It's not like that! This Hige guy's just really good!

00:07:30.324 --> 00:07:32.724
He pulled off a hat trick in the first half!

00:07:35.894 --> 00:07:37.864
He's the hero of this game.

00:07:38.794 --> 00:07:41.394
Nice shot, Hige!

00:07:42.064 --> 00:07:43.464
Yeah!

00:07:43.874 --> 00:07:45.034
The score's 3-0!

00:07:45.034 --> 00:07:48.004
Forget the stupid game! What about Shiho?!

00:07:48.004 --> 00:07:49.204
Umm...

00:07:49.204 --> 00:07:52.304
Did I screw up our deployment?
Handle things here!

00:07:58.654 --> 00:08:00.714
The origin of pudding is...

00:08:02.424 --> 00:08:03.454
Huh? Akashi.

00:08:03.454 --> 00:08:06.054
This is no time to be eating pudding!
Where's Shiho?!

00:08:06.054 --> 00:08:08.554
Over there. The game just ended.

00:08:09.964 --> 00:08:11.094
Good job.

00:08:11.094 --> 00:08:12.434
Thanks.

00:08:12.434 --> 00:08:14.664
That last shot was amazing!

00:08:14.664 --> 00:08:16.464
I was surprised, too.

00:08:19.774 --> 00:08:24.144
Maybe I got it in because you were
cheering me on, Miss Sannomiya.

00:08:24.144 --> 00:08:26.044
That was all you, Hige.

00:08:26.044 --> 00:08:27.214
Huh?

00:08:27.214 --> 00:08:29.544
You were really cool out there, Hige.

00:08:29.984 --> 00:08:34.254
No way! Miss #1 Wicked Girl Character,
acting that nice?!

00:08:34.254 --> 00:08:36.254
Wicked girl character?

00:08:36.254 --> 00:08:39.554
I have another game this afternoon, but...

00:08:40.264 --> 00:08:42.464
Maybe I should watch that one, too.

00:08:42.464 --> 00:08:44.164
We can go home together when it's done.

00:08:44.164 --> 00:08:46.224
Really? Well, in that case...

00:08:47.864 --> 00:08:49.504
The two of them, sharing a box lunch,

00:08:49.504 --> 00:08:51.774
and me watching them getting
all gooey, lovey-dovey!

00:08:51.774 --> 00:08:53.944
Shiho, you've gone rotten!

00:08:53.944 --> 00:08:55.844
This is stupid and I'm going home now.

00:08:55.844 --> 00:08:57.114
Two Crab King cards says you won't!

00:08:57.114 --> 00:08:59.144
Yes! I'll do it!

00:08:59.144 --> 00:09:01.144
Gimme! Gimme!

00:09:01.144 --> 00:09:02.974
Now it's email from Chisato!

00:09:20.434 --> 00:09:22.024
He's so nice!

00:09:23.134 --> 00:09:24.334
Whoa, Akashi, whoa!

00:09:25.734 --> 00:09:30.044
Sorry. I didn't mean to fall asleep before.

00:09:30.044 --> 00:09:33.104
Well, I kind of dozed off too, by accident.

00:09:36.514 --> 00:09:38.514
Do you go to the planetarium a lot?

00:09:38.514 --> 00:09:43.294
Yeah. I'd like to join the space
program when I grow up.

00:09:43.294 --> 00:09:45.494
You want to be an astronaut?

00:09:45.494 --> 00:09:50.434
I'd like to go to space, but I'd be
happy to be support personnel, too.

00:09:50.434 --> 00:09:52.234
Support?

00:09:52.234 --> 00:09:56.674
A lot of people work in the
shadows for projects that big.

00:09:56.674 --> 00:09:59.334
I may not ever get famous, but...

00:09:59.334 --> 00:10:02.964
Yeah. I'd like to become something like that, too.

00:10:03.414 --> 00:10:06.284
What gives? Why is she reacting to talking

00:10:06.284 --> 00:10:08.984
about such an immature, simple dream?!

00:10:08.984 --> 00:10:11.114
Get away from him, Aoi! It's a trap!

00:10:11.114 --> 00:10:13.784
Akashi, I really need to go.

00:10:13.784 --> 00:10:16.894
Why?! If you leave me alone now, I'll start to cry!

00:10:16.894 --> 00:10:19.584
We shouldn't interfere with their date.

00:10:20.064 --> 00:10:20.894
Besides.

00:10:20.894 --> 00:10:21.924
Besides?

00:10:21.924 --> 00:10:24.294
Tono says he wants to hang out someplace.

00:10:24.294 --> 00:10:26.234
Sorry! Catch you later!

00:10:26.234 --> 00:10:28.864
Agh! There it was! I just got
the characters wrong!

00:10:37.744 --> 00:10:39.784
This sucks.

00:10:39.784 --> 00:10:42.904
This just... This sucks!

00:10:43.314 --> 00:10:44.714
This sucks!

00:10:45.054 --> 00:10:47.084
This totally sucks!

00:10:47.084 --> 00:10:48.024
Chief!

00:10:48.024 --> 00:10:49.224
What? Yes?

00:10:49.224 --> 00:10:52.814
Don't be so childish. They're
good girls, aren't they?

00:10:54.964 --> 00:10:59.124
All right, I will accept their relationships with
The Children, our national treasures.

00:10:59.494 --> 00:11:03.874
However, only if these boys can
pass a test of my own devising!

00:11:03.874 --> 00:11:06.034
Test, sir?

00:11:06.034 --> 00:11:08.944
Order my personal team into action!

00:11:08.944 --> 00:11:10.344
Chief!

00:11:10.344 --> 00:11:11.774
Call sign, confirmed!

00:11:12.614 --> 00:11:15.814
Chief Kiritsubo Assault Unit, A-Team, scramble!

00:11:15.814 --> 00:11:18.254
Do everything in our power to stop
these elementary school dates!

00:11:18.254 --> 00:11:19.084
Seriously?

00:11:19.554 --> 00:11:21.224
I go for the second-born son.

00:11:21.224 --> 00:11:22.914
He should have a nice car for the date.

00:11:23.224 --> 00:11:25.024
And he needs to be rich.

00:11:25.094 --> 00:11:26.654
The type who'll slightly spoil a girl.

00:11:29.894 --> 00:11:31.694
M-My name's Kuroki!

00:11:34.764 --> 00:11:36.704
Excuse me, but my name isn't read as "Hishita."

00:11:39.504 --> 00:11:43.674
We've been together, ever since that day.

00:11:44.714 --> 00:11:46.804
Why did this have to happen?

00:11:47.844 --> 00:11:50.714
You like high places this much?

00:11:50.714 --> 00:11:52.954
No, it's not that.

00:11:52.954 --> 00:11:56.184
Wait, Minamoto? How'd you know I was here?

00:11:56.184 --> 00:11:58.854
Your limiter has a GPS function, too.

00:12:00.194 --> 00:12:01.024
Oh.

00:12:03.134 --> 00:12:04.924
Wanna get something good to eat?

00:12:06.634 --> 00:12:08.964
Gyoza goes best with fried rice, am I right?

00:12:08.964 --> 00:12:12.634
I'm Kent! I'm Delica! Let the two of them meet...

00:12:13.044 --> 00:12:14.604
That's cool!

00:12:14.604 --> 00:12:16.174
How's it dance?

00:12:16.174 --> 00:12:19.734
Is it shape memory metal?! It's a triumph
of technology, right, Minamoto?!

00:12:20.614 --> 00:12:23.284
Okay, where to, next?

00:12:23.284 --> 00:12:25.314
Hey! You want to shop some more?

00:12:25.314 --> 00:12:27.324
Shopping relieves stress.

00:12:27.324 --> 00:12:29.444
In short, it is the essence of a girl's heart.

00:12:30.054 --> 00:12:31.954
There are limits to everything!

00:12:31.954 --> 00:12:32.924
How many tons?

00:12:38.934 --> 00:12:41.404
I wonder what they're doing now.

00:12:44.904 --> 00:12:45.934
BABEL-1?

00:12:45.934 --> 00:12:47.634
Is there an accident near here?

00:12:48.474 --> 00:12:49.464
Chief, what's up?

00:12:51.014 --> 00:12:52.474
Communications are blocked.

00:12:55.144 --> 00:12:56.844
This is Alpha 1. Target, acquired.

00:12:57.354 --> 00:12:58.974
All right, commence the attack!

00:12:59.384 --> 00:13:00.714
Roger. Let's go!

00:13:01.954 --> 00:13:04.024
You were really cool, Hige.

00:13:04.024 --> 00:13:06.724
Because you were cheering
me on, Miss Sannomiya.

00:13:07.024 --> 00:13:08.764
That's not true.

00:13:08.764 --> 00:13:13.894
If I could, I'd have you cheering
for me from now on...

00:13:17.804 --> 00:13:19.204
Miss Sannomiya!

00:13:19.204 --> 00:13:23.104
Bad dog, Rosemary! Running off like that!

00:13:23.474 --> 00:13:26.104
Attack, successful! Love confession, averted!

00:13:26.914 --> 00:13:28.884
Are you all right, Miss Sannomiya?

00:13:30.184 --> 00:13:31.584
Yes.

00:13:35.484 --> 00:13:39.454
Hige, do you know about my ESP?

00:13:39.454 --> 00:13:42.164
If I touch you, I may read your mind.

00:13:42.164 --> 00:13:45.994
I heard, but... I don't really mind.

00:13:45.994 --> 00:13:51.094
I think it's cool that you can know my feelings,
even without me using words, so...

00:13:52.404 --> 00:13:56.934
I don't need to touch you to know
you wanted to hold my hand.

00:13:57.474 --> 00:14:01.844
Uh-oh! This has just made the mood
even more romantic than before!

00:14:01.844 --> 00:14:03.874
Squad 2, prepare for attack!

00:14:04.714 --> 00:14:07.914
Suppose my level was higher...

00:14:08.724 --> 00:14:10.454
Miss Sannomiya?

00:14:11.024 --> 00:14:13.894
And with just a touch, I could read all the things

00:14:13.894 --> 00:14:16.384
deep in your heart that you wanted to hide...

00:14:19.164 --> 00:14:21.724
What? I couldn't hear you.

00:14:21.964 --> 00:14:24.534
I said, with just a touch, I could read...

00:14:24.534 --> 00:14:26.304
Never mind.

00:14:26.304 --> 00:14:26.934
Okay.

00:14:27.404 --> 00:14:29.874
Alpha team, disruption of
conversation, successful!

00:14:32.614 --> 00:14:36.374
Bone conduction mics, and long-range
wireless headsets with micro-monitors.

00:14:37.114 --> 00:14:38.984
Heavy-duty equipment for a road crew, huh?

00:14:42.554 --> 00:14:44.214
Hold it right there!

00:14:44.754 --> 00:14:47.654
Yo! Yo! Check me out, baby! Yo!

00:14:49.224 --> 00:14:53.934
Hey, baby! Why don't you ditch that
loser and give us some lovin'?

00:14:53.934 --> 00:14:56.904
You guys are seriously hitting
on an elementary school kid?

00:14:58.134 --> 00:15:00.074
No holding back with her opinions, huh?

00:15:00.074 --> 00:15:02.164
Get lost before I report you!

00:15:02.774 --> 00:15:04.714
Could you give us a minute, please?

00:15:04.714 --> 00:15:06.504
Just a minute.

00:15:06.984 --> 00:15:07.944
What do we do?!

00:15:07.944 --> 00:15:10.184
Our mission is to disrupt their date.

00:15:10.184 --> 00:15:13.744
I'd gladly sacrifice myself to keep
The Children from breaking up!

00:15:14.284 --> 00:15:19.984
But have we endured our rigorous
training till now just to do this?

00:15:20.264 --> 00:15:22.794
Don't say that! This is for our nation!

00:15:22.794 --> 00:15:24.734
There's no other path open to us!

00:15:30.034 --> 00:15:31.374
Miss Nogami!

00:15:31.374 --> 00:15:34.304
If it weren't for my limiter, I could
handle these guys without a problem.

00:15:34.304 --> 00:15:36.364
In this case, running is the winning move!

00:15:36.614 --> 00:15:37.714
Hey!

00:15:37.714 --> 00:15:38.574
Hold it!

00:15:45.454 --> 00:15:47.184
What are you doing?!

00:15:47.184 --> 00:15:50.724
Sorry, sir. We lost the target.

00:15:50.724 --> 00:15:52.654
Pathetic! Pathetic!

00:15:52.654 --> 00:15:55.194
This is my personal squad?

00:15:55.194 --> 00:15:57.364
It can't even disrupt a date?!

00:15:57.364 --> 00:15:58.864
Chief.

00:15:58.864 --> 00:16:02.104
You people are... Minamoto, what
are you doing here?!

00:16:02.104 --> 00:16:03.404
I called him.

00:16:03.404 --> 00:16:05.574
What is going on here?!

00:16:05.574 --> 00:16:07.834
Supervisor Minamoto, you came
right in the nick of time!

00:16:08.544 --> 00:16:10.974
Wow, that's a lot of spy cams you set up.

00:16:10.974 --> 00:16:14.244
It's to ensure the safety of The Children, so...

00:16:14.244 --> 00:16:17.254
You mean you're spying on elementary
school kids having a date?!

00:16:17.254 --> 00:16:18.014
Uh, well...

00:16:18.014 --> 00:16:21.424
Too soft... Just watching them is being too soft!

00:16:21.424 --> 00:16:22.624
Too soft?

00:16:22.624 --> 00:16:26.694
We have to wreck these dates completely!

00:16:26.694 --> 00:16:28.494
Akashi, what are you saying?!

00:16:28.494 --> 00:16:30.394
Aren't you their friend?!

00:16:30.394 --> 00:16:31.794
SHUT UP!

00:16:33.364 --> 00:16:36.904
I will save my friends who are
lost in this maze called love!

00:16:36.904 --> 00:16:39.274
This is the true form of friendship!

00:16:39.274 --> 00:16:42.904
The dark side of girl friendship!

00:16:42.904 --> 00:16:44.644
She's gone over to the dark side!

00:16:44.644 --> 00:16:46.204
Why, Kaoru?!

00:16:46.884 --> 00:16:47.714
Shiho!

00:16:47.714 --> 00:16:49.014
Aoi!

00:16:49.014 --> 00:16:51.854
Sorry. It's like I told you before.

00:16:51.854 --> 00:16:54.984
We've been having weird
things happen to us, too.

00:16:54.984 --> 00:16:57.924
And it's odd that we can't contact Mr. Minamoto.

00:16:58.554 --> 00:17:01.154
I think we should stick together from here on.

00:17:05.964 --> 00:17:07.004
Kuroki!

00:17:07.004 --> 00:17:08.794
H-Hige, what's with you?

00:17:10.534 --> 00:17:11.834
Hige!

00:17:12.174 --> 00:17:13.474
See, you two?

00:17:13.474 --> 00:17:17.464
I'll reveal the true nature of
men and ruin your dates!

00:17:17.544 --> 00:17:20.874
I call it Operation Men Are Wolves!

00:17:21.714 --> 00:17:26.154
Suffer! Struggle! This is your
punishment for falling in love!

00:17:26.154 --> 00:17:29.654
Aoi! Somebody nearby is controlling them!

00:17:29.654 --> 00:17:31.224
I know!

00:17:31.224 --> 00:17:34.214
I'm sensing them with my
spatial recognition powers!

00:17:34.724 --> 00:17:36.124
There!

00:17:37.494 --> 00:17:38.424
Uh-oh.

00:17:39.464 --> 00:17:40.464
Kaoru!

00:17:40.464 --> 00:17:41.794
Crap!

00:17:43.874 --> 00:17:45.104
Kaoru!

00:17:45.104 --> 00:17:46.704
What's the deal here?

00:17:46.704 --> 00:17:49.144
Huh? What am I doing here?

00:17:49.144 --> 00:17:50.774
Don't play dumb!

00:17:50.774 --> 00:17:52.674
You dragged Hige and Kuroki into this?!

00:17:52.674 --> 00:17:55.704
And don't you dare tell us you forgot
what you were doing to them!

00:17:56.684 --> 00:17:58.914
Wait, please!

00:18:00.024 --> 00:18:01.724
There's a reason for this.

00:18:01.724 --> 00:18:03.224
We work for BABEL.

00:18:03.224 --> 00:18:04.954
Of course you do.

00:18:04.954 --> 00:18:07.294
This was all the chief's idea.

00:18:07.294 --> 00:18:09.554
Miss Akashi was only doing
what the chief asked her to.

00:18:09.624 --> 00:18:11.354
She's not at all to blame!

00:18:11.834 --> 00:18:13.934
Right! Yes! That!

00:18:13.934 --> 00:18:15.664
Liar.

00:18:15.664 --> 00:18:17.194
You were just jealous,

00:18:17.304 --> 00:18:20.104
so you went along with the chief's
plan to ruin our dates.

00:18:20.104 --> 00:18:21.594
If I lie, you'll kill me instantly!

00:18:21.674 --> 00:18:22.844
Kaoru! You are...

00:18:22.844 --> 00:18:23.774
The worst!

00:18:23.774 --> 00:18:24.644
The lamest!

00:18:25.244 --> 00:18:27.004
The worst! The lamest!

00:18:27.614 --> 00:18:28.784
Let's go, Aoi.

00:18:28.784 --> 00:18:29.944
Right.

00:18:29.944 --> 00:18:33.854
Let's ask Mr. Minamoto to release our
limiters so we can get the boys home.

00:18:33.854 --> 00:18:36.684
No! This date ends now!

00:18:36.684 --> 00:18:37.854
You're still saying that?

00:18:37.854 --> 00:18:39.524
As many times as I must!

00:18:39.524 --> 00:18:42.254
You are our nation's special espers!

00:18:42.694 --> 00:18:45.894
You will not be permitted to fall
in love with ordinary people!

00:18:46.634 --> 00:18:48.804
This is a gross violation of our human rights!

00:18:48.804 --> 00:18:50.874
You think our limiters will hold us back

00:18:50.874 --> 00:18:52.774
if we really want to get out of here?!

00:18:52.774 --> 00:18:54.674
You leave me no choice.

00:18:54.674 --> 00:18:56.664
Activate ECM!

00:18:58.514 --> 00:19:00.634
Physically restrain them!

00:19:01.284 --> 00:19:02.014
Shiho!

00:19:02.014 --> 00:19:03.314
Aoi!

00:19:07.754 --> 00:19:09.224
I'm sorry.

00:19:09.224 --> 00:19:13.424
I... I forgot!

00:19:16.864 --> 00:19:19.234
True friends...

00:19:19.234 --> 00:19:24.634
It's friends who understand each others'
feelings and trust each other!

00:19:24.634 --> 00:19:27.304
And instead, I just...

00:19:27.304 --> 00:19:29.834
I just thought of myself!

00:19:30.214 --> 00:19:32.474
Okay, you almost have it... There!

00:19:32.574 --> 00:19:36.184
Well done! This is power!
The power of the State!

00:19:36.184 --> 00:19:38.054
The peace of Japan is assured!

00:19:38.054 --> 00:19:41.424
Kaoru Akashi! Limiter, released!

00:19:41.424 --> 00:19:42.054
<<RELEASED>>
Kaoru Akashi! Limiter, released!

00:19:46.024 --> 00:19:50.794
Get your hands off of my precious friends!

00:20:01.544 --> 00:20:03.744
A-Team, what happened?! Come in!

00:20:03.744 --> 00:20:04.804
I'd say...

00:20:05.674 --> 00:20:07.444
your plan failed, sir.

00:20:08.144 --> 00:20:09.584
How?!

00:20:09.584 --> 00:20:13.344
Everyone is sick and tired
of this stupid operation!

00:20:15.124 --> 00:20:16.784
What's stupid about it?!

00:20:16.784 --> 00:20:20.324
If we let them date boys,
The Children will break up!

00:20:20.324 --> 00:20:24.554
Those girls won't betray their friendship
over a couple of boyfriends!

00:20:25.134 --> 00:20:26.434
B-But...

00:20:26.434 --> 00:20:29.334
Chief, do you think a child can trust an adult

00:20:29.404 --> 00:20:31.804
who won't trust them in return?

00:20:32.674 --> 00:20:33.174
They'll hate you otherwise.

00:20:33.174 --> 00:20:34.244
Let's have faith. In those girls' future.
They'll hate you otherwise.

00:20:34.244 --> 00:20:35.864
Let's have faith. In those girls' future.
They wouldn't!

00:20:36.604 --> 00:20:37.814
Kuroki...

00:20:37.814 --> 00:20:39.834
They're okay, just unconscious.

00:20:40.314 --> 00:20:44.114
Shiho... Aoi... I'm sorry!

00:20:46.354 --> 00:20:49.724
I was jealous because everyone else had dates.

00:20:49.724 --> 00:20:52.594
I felt like I was being left behind!

00:20:52.594 --> 00:20:54.524
I'm really sorry!

00:20:55.464 --> 00:20:57.534
This was the lamest thing you've ever done.

00:20:57.534 --> 00:20:59.834
It's not like you, Kaoru.

00:20:59.834 --> 00:21:01.564
The Kaoru we know...

00:21:01.564 --> 00:21:02.864
Is hot-headed.

00:21:02.864 --> 00:21:03.874
Simpleminded.

00:21:03.874 --> 00:21:04.874
Stubborn.

00:21:04.874 --> 00:21:05.734
Vain.

00:21:05.734 --> 00:21:06.874
Hey...

00:21:06.874 --> 00:21:09.004
But manlier than anyone.

00:21:09.004 --> 00:21:10.874
The girl who's cooler than anyone.

00:21:11.314 --> 00:21:14.014
Those aren't compliments!

00:21:14.014 --> 00:21:18.914
But thank you, Shiho! Aoi!

00:21:20.054 --> 00:21:21.074
Sorry!

00:21:22.824 --> 00:21:24.994
Our date yesterday was so much fun!

00:21:24.994 --> 00:21:29.664
But there's someone else that we both like. So...

00:21:29.664 --> 00:21:31.524
Let's just be good friends!

00:21:31.964 --> 00:21:33.454
See you!

00:21:34.134 --> 00:21:34.804
Just...

00:21:34.804 --> 00:21:36.164
friends.

00:21:39.274 --> 00:21:41.144
I'm so popular!

00:21:41.144 --> 00:21:43.644
Still, I wanted to go on a date, too.

00:21:43.644 --> 00:21:45.514
You did. With Mr. Minamoto.

00:21:45.514 --> 00:21:47.884
What?! Kaoru, you edged us out again?!

00:21:47.884 --> 00:21:50.954
What are you talking about? All we did...

00:21:50.954 --> 00:21:54.214
was go out to eat, shop, and walk
around having a good time...

00:21:54.624 --> 00:21:57.384
Wait... That was a date?!

00:21:57.924 --> 00:22:00.294
Darn it! I wanted to walk arm in arm,

00:22:00.294 --> 00:22:05.234
play tag on the beach, and drink from
the same juice with two straws!

00:22:05.234 --> 00:22:06.134
Right, right.

00:22:06.134 --> 00:22:08.204
Darn it! I'll get 'em next time!

00:22:08.204 --> 00:22:09.754
Right, right, right.

00:22:10.734 --> 00:22:16.174
DATTE Daihon'mei

00:22:16.174 --> 00:22:16.474
Yeah

00:22:33.524 --> 00:22:36.794
Anata no mae jaa, hora

00:22:38.534 --> 00:22:44.064
ESP mo yaku ni tatanai no

00:22:44.404 --> 00:22:50.534
Pitagorasu de sae mo kaimei dekinai

00:22:50.914 --> 00:22:53.174
Koi wa chie no wa

00:22:55.414 --> 00:23:00.114
Naki sou na kao shite utsumuicha dame da yo

00:23:00.554 --> 00:23:05.424
Egao kara kiseki wa umareru da mon

00:23:06.094 --> 00:23:07.524
DA DA Daihon'mei

00:23:07.524 --> 00:23:07.824
Kyun kyun!

00:23:07.824 --> 00:23:08.824
Anata wo

00:23:08.824 --> 00:23:09.264
Bye-bye!

00:23:09.264 --> 00:23:12.994
Daitan futeki mono shitai

00:23:13.134 --> 00:23:17.134
Kanari tsubireru hodo maji na no zettai!

00:23:17.134 --> 00:23:18.574
DA DA Daihenshin

00:23:18.574 --> 00:23:18.874
Kyun kyun!

00:23:18.874 --> 00:23:19.834
Anata e

00:23:19.834 --> 00:23:20.474
Hai hai!

00:23:20.474 --> 00:23:25.304
Dainamaito na kuchidzuke wo ageru

00:23:25.444 --> 00:23:28.214
Suki na'tte hoshii no zettai!

00:23:28.214 --> 00:23:38.414
DATTE Daihon'mei

00:23:39.954 --> 00:23:41.094
NEXT EPISODE

00:23:41.094 --> 00:23:42.964
NEXT EPISODE
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:42.964 --> 00:23:43.264
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:43.264 --> 00:23:44.894
What's wrong with old man Tanizaki?

00:23:44.894 --> 00:23:47.034
I realized something disturbing yesterday.

00:23:47.034 --> 00:23:49.204
Naomi's attitude towards me has grown cold.

00:23:49.204 --> 00:23:50.134
Huh? Just now?

00:23:50.134 --> 00:23:52.774
Naomi may be turning to a life of crime!

00:23:52.774 --> 00:23:53.604
Life of crime?

00:23:53.604 --> 00:23:57.414
I want your help in rehabilitating Naomi!

00:23:57.414 --> 00:23:58.914
Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:58.914 --> 00:24:02.414
Episode 19: "Runaway Angel!
It Can't Be My Naomi!"

00:24:02.414 --> 00:24:04.154
Don't touch me with your disgusting hands!

00:24:04.154 --> 00:24:04.984
I have enough stressing me out as it is!

00:24:04.984 --> 00:24:06.514
Runaway Angel!
It Can't Be My Naomi!
I have enough stressing me out as it is!

00:24:06.514 --> 00:24:08.784
Runaway Angel!
It Can't Be My Naomi!
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:08.784 --> 00:24:09.944
Runaway Angel!
It Can't Be My Naomi!
